				<div class="col-12 col-md-8 m-auto contact__numbers-title text-center">
					<span class="tertiary-heading d-block mb-4">MANTRA PROPERTIES</span>
					<h2 class="secondary-heading mb-4">We Would Love To Hear From You</h2>
					<p class="paragraph">To send us your queries, feedback and suggestions, please refer to the appropriate sections below and fill in the form. Someone from the team will get in touch with you at the earliest.</p>
